# B13 depth-grid completion, all groups
# Generated by scripts/gen_campaign_configs.py. Three seeds for both
# methods, as in B10. Run groups in order a -> b -> c.
# L6 becomes a two-method ROW but is NOT a symmetric cross-method
# comparison: full FT takes embed_positions and every LayerNorm, LoRA
# takes neither. Report L6 within method, each arm against its own L5;
# L5 stays the cross-method headline.
# The l0_lora/l0_full lines are seed top-ups on EXISTING b2/b3 cells and
# write into the existing output_dir on purpose. Drop them if n=1 at L0
# is acceptable -- the grid is complete without them.
# job_id	config	seed	run_name	output_dir	extra
